  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The DependencyManager is a critical bootstrapping service responsible for centralizing the registration of all core engine components, including Entities, Materials, Primitives, and Shaders. It populates the ObjectInstanciator with necessary factory functions and metadata, enabling dynamic object instantiation from serialized scene data. Its primary function is bridging the gap between named data and live runtime objects, ensuring correct construction during deserialization."
  },
